.TH "WORKFLOW-PROCESS-TIMEOUTS" 1 "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
workflow:process-timeouts \- Process SLA timeouts on entities and trigger automatic escalation transitions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php workflow:process-timeouts
[\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBworkflow:process-timeouts\fR command monitors active workflow SLA deadlines recorded in the \fBspp_workflow_slas\fR table. When a deadline expires, it automatically executes the configured escalation transition on the entity, logging full audit lineage.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Simulate escalation checks without mutating entity state or purging SLA records.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Queries expired records from \fBspp_workflow_slas\fR, hydrates entities via \fBSPPEntity::find()\fR, verifies current state markings, and dispatches transitions via \fBSPPEntity::applyTransition()\fR.
